[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_04_0010","text":"……嘶\n好冷……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_04_0020","text":"拍摄，看起来一时半会儿开始不了呢～\n出什么问题了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_04_0030","text":"没有大衣外套的话真受不了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_04_0040","text":"咦？\n话说，朝日酱不见了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_04_0050","text":"在这里～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_04_0060","text":"……别穿着戏服坐在地上"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_04_0070","text":"没事的！屁股没沾地\n你看，抬头看上面很有趣哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_04_0080","text":"啊……／哦哦～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_04_0090","text":"好厉害啊～♪\n冬优子酱，连冷都忘掉了呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_04_0100","text":"…………\n好冷"}]
